  "system": {
    "identifier": "jugo-natures-surge",
    "description": "<p>You reach up and feel the Nature energy in the surrounding area and by forcing your body to accept it, you forcibly gain 3 Nature Energy. Nature Energy gained this way, allows you to go above your maximum amount of Nature Energy you can normally hold. If this excess Nature Energy isn’t spent before the end of the current turn, it is lost.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank above C-Rank you cast this jutsu, increase the cost by 3 and the amount of Nature Energy gained by +2.</p>",
